    "MLY_Fortress_Malaya": "Fortress Malaya",
    "MLY_Fortress_Malaya_tt": "Despite our connections to Azad Hind, we stand utterly alone. If Japan ever returns, it's not a guarantee even Azad Hind will assist us.",
